n class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>基于因子图的优化</strong>：将所有传感器约束统一建模为因子节点，通过 GTSAM 等库进行增量式优化，适合处理异步、异频的多源数据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;RGB 相机&quot;] --&gt; E[&quot;特征提取&quot;]&#10;    B[&quot;深度相机&quot;] --&gt; F[&quot;点云生成&quot;]&#10;    C[&quot;IMU&quot;] --&gt; G[&quot;预积分&quot;]&#10;    D[&quot;力/扭矩传感器&quot;] --&gt; H[&quot;接触检测&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; I[&quot;融合层 Factor Graph&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; I&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J[&quot;统一世界模型&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"RGB 相机\"] --&gt; E[\"特征提取\"]\n    B[\"深度相机\"] --&gt; F[\"点云生成\"]\n    C[\"IMU\"] --&gt; G[\"预积分\"]\n    D[\"力/扭矩传感器\"] --&gt; H[\"接触检测\"]\n    E --&gt; I[\"融合层 Factor Graph\"]\n    F --&gt; I\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J[\"统一世界模型\"]</pre><h3 id=\"时空对齐与标定\">时空对齐与标定</h3><p>多传感器系统的前提是精确的时空标定：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>空间标定</strong>：确定传感器之间的相对位姿 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{cam}^{lidar}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0961em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">am</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，常用棋盘格、AprilTag 等标定物</li>\n<li><strong>时间同步</strong>：处理不同传感器的采样率差异（相机 30Hz vs IMU 200Hz），通过硬件触发或软件插值实现对齐</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>神经辐射场（NeRF）融合触觉</strong>：2025年多项工作将触觉信息嵌入 NeRF 表示，实现物体物理属性（如刚度分布）的隐式重建</li>\n<li><strong>基础模型驱动的开放世界感知</strong>：SAM2、Grounding DINO 等模型让机器人无需训练即可分割和识别任意物体</li>\n<li><strong>事件相机 + 标准相机融合</strong>：利用事件流的高时间分辨率弥补传统相机的运动模糊问题</li>\n<li><strong>大规模触觉数据集</strong>：Touch and Go、TACTO 等平台推动触觉预训练模型的发展</li>\n<li><strong>端到端感知-动作模型</strong>：跳过显式感知中间表示，直接从原始传感器数据到控制指令</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>推导 EKF 中状态预测步骤和更新步骤的完整数学表达。当系统高度非线性时，EKF 的线性化近似会带来什么问题？UKF 和粒子滤波如何缓解？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>使用 Open3D 库加载一组 RGB-D 图像序列，实现基于 ICP 的点云拼接，重建一个桌面场景的三维模型。分析不同 ICP 变体（point-to-point vs point-to-plane）的收敛速度差异。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计实验：一个机械臂需要从桌面上抓取一个透明玻璃杯。讨论为什么纯视觉方案会失败，以及如何结合触觉传感器和力反馈来实现可靠抓取。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>思考：对于一个配备了 3 个 RGB 相机、1 个 LiDAR、1 个 IMU 和 2 个力传感器的人形机器人，如何设计其传感器融合架构？哪些信息应该早期融合（raw level），哪些适合晚期融合（decision level）？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>多模态感知融合赋予具身智能体全面理解物理世界的能力。从单模态的视觉、触觉、力感知，到多源信息的贝叶斯融合与因子图优化，本节建立了从原始传感器数据到统一世界模型的完整技术链路。这一感知基础为后续的决策规划和物理交互提供了关键输入。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多模态感知融合","id":"多模态感知融合"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"视觉感知基础","id":"视觉感知基础"},{"level":3,"text":"触觉与力感知","id":"触觉与力感知"},{"level":3,"text":"点云处理与三维表示","id":"点云处理与三维表示"},{"level":3,"text":"传感器融合框架","id":"传感器融合框架"},{"level":3,"text":"时空对齐与标定","id":"时空对齐与标定"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"机器人动力学与运动学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence/foundations-and-perception/robot-dynamics-kinematics"},"next":{"title":"场景理解与语义建图","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence/foundations-and-perception/scene-understanding"}}